      "message": "mempool: report sequence of txs removed for block\n\nTransactions removed from the mempool because they were included in a\nblock are only reported through MempoolTransactionsRemovedForBlock,\nwhich did not carry the mempool sequence consumed by each removal.\nWithout it, subscribers cannot order these removals relative to other\nmempool additions and removals.\n\nReturn the sequence from removeUnchecked and store it in\nRemovedMempoolTransactionInfo. It is used by the Events interface\nadded in the next commit.",
